<h1>Tofu Chocolate Pudding</h1>
<h2>Ingredients</h2>
<ul>
<li>12 ounces silken tofu, drained</li>
<li>1/2 cup unsweetened cocoa powder</li>
<li>1/3 cup maple syrup</li>
<li>1 teaspoon vanilla extract</li>
<li>1/8 teaspoon salt</li>
</ul>
<h2>Steps</h2>
<ol>
<li>Add all ingredients to a blender.</li>
<li>Blend until completely smooth and creamy.</li>
<li>Chill for at least 1 hour before serving to allow it to set and develop flavor.</li>
<li>Serve topped with berries, shaved dark chocolate, or a dollop of coconut cream.</li>
</ol>
